WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:03,780
What's going on?

2
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:06,020
red fox

3
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:07,220
Long time no see

4
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:08,820
I almost don’t recognize you

5
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:10,450
Not big or small

6
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:12,450
I can be considered your master now.

7
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:13,850
Dare you ask the master about his reputation?

8
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:15,700
Hu Yifu

9
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:20,590
Someone will come to break into the hall later

10
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:21,790
are you ready

11
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:23,490
of course ready

12
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:25,490
Besides, aren't you here?

13
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:28,290
I'll just hit you and it's fine, Xiaotie

14
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:30,270
Remember one sentence

15
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,800
If one day you can't see us anymore

16
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,860
Don't be afraid, don't panic, Second Auntie

17
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:37,260
What does this mean

18
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:39,460
I'll give you an address and a name

19
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:40,660
you must remember

20
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:42,460
If you want to meet again, go find him

21
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:44,060
If you don't want to, just live a good life

22
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:46,460
We'll make sure you have enough food and clothing to eat and drink

23
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:48,460
What are you talking about? Where are you going?

24
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:55,240
It's time for you to wake up. Who's there?

25
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:59,640
Talk to me, second aunt Zheng Xiaocui Xiaocui

26
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,160
Where are you all?

27
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,960
Who will talk to me?

28
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:05,360
Dad is gone

29
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:06,360
Grandpa is gone

30
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:08,560
Mom is gone now too

31
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:10,560
Are you even leaving?

32
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,560
I'll give you an address and a name

33
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:13,760
you must remember

34
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:15,760
If you want to meet again, go find him

35
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:17,960
I, Zhou Tie, have lost my father since I was a child.

36
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:19,160
Mom ran away too

37
00:01:19,390 --> 00:01:20,790
But I never blamed her

38
00:01:20,990 --> 00:01:22,390
She deserves a better life

39
00:01:23,050 --> 00:01:24,650
You shouldn't be carrying this degreasing bottle of mine

40
00:01:25,460 --> 00:01:26,460
After grandpa left

41
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:27,860
I became a person

42
00:01:28,830 --> 00:01:30,030
until you find me

43
00:01:30,030 --> 00:01:31,430
At first I was afraid of rejection

44
00:01:31,630 --> 00:01:33,230
Just to survive and not be scared to death

45
00:01:33,790 --> 00:01:34,990
But these days

46
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:37,900
I have long regarded you as my family

47
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:39,700
Even if I, Zhou Tie, no longer care about things

48
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:41,100
I don't want to leave you either

49
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:43,960
This time it's up to me to get you back.
